# Component stories

Any `src/**/components/**/*.tsx` module (except `*.stories.tsx`) must have a sibling story file:

`Component.tsx` → `Component.stories.tsx`

When adding or renaming a component under `components/`, add or rename the story in the same change. Do not leave components without stories.
